                        "text": "{\"data\":[{\"thumbnail\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/50d12500-877d-4a31-a7b3-2a52567efd36/thumbnail\",\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"iiif_manifest\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/50d12500-877d-4a31-a7b3-2a52567efd36?as=iiif\",\"description\":[\"Un paysage du Ruanda: Strie\u0301es de haies paralle\u0300les qui servent a\u0300 combattre l'e\u0301rosion, des collines aux do\u0302mes arrondis s'e\u0301le\u0300vent au bord des champs de sorghe. ; Photo: J. Mulders ; No. 42.23/4 ; Congopresse ; Reproduction libre avec ou sans mention d'origine. ; Tous droits re\u0301serve\u0301s pour l'e\u0301dition de cartes postales, gravures, etc... ; 5 ; RU-5--Verso\"],\"id\":\"50d12500-877d-4a31-a7b3-2a52567efd36\",\"collection\":{\"id\":\"1d849df1-eb32-43f4-b7b9-e435cff18f7c\",\"title\":\"Vernon McKay Photographs\"},\"title\":\"Au Ruanda-Urundi\"},{\"thumbnail\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/1e2e79cd-a927-49e4-a3d2-7a6f98878cff/thumbnail\",\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"iiif_manifest\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/1e2e79cd-a927-49e4-a3d2-7a6f98878cff?as=iiif\",\"description\":[\"By K. Venkatappa, Bangalore.\",\"Photographed in 2008 to 2009.\"],\"id\":\"1e2e79cd-a927-49e4-a3d2-7a6f98878cff\",\"collection\":{\"id\":\"85af945f-1396-4b88-9087-c4f2fa64d21c\",\"title\":\"Rob Linrothe Image Collection\"},\"title\":\"Painting of landscape.\"},{\"thumbnail\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/f98563f8-3baa-42d9-a8c6-e62d9eac267c/thumbnail\",\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"iiif_manifest\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/f98563f8-3baa-42d9-a8c6-e62d9eac267c?as=iiif\",\"description\":[\"A42 ; 38 ; SE-38 -- Verso\"],\"id\":\"f98563f8-3baa-42d9-a8c6-e62d9eac267c\",\"collection\":{\"id\":\"1d849df1-eb32-43f4-b7b9-e435cff18f7c\",\"title\":\"Vernon McKay Photographs\"},\"title\":\"Landscape view of bushes in foreground, an ocean wit