                        "text": "{\"data\":[{\"thumbnail\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/c423c63f-290d-4fdb-879b-8b5813b1f94c/thumbnail\",\"visibility\":\"Public\",\"iiif_manifest\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/works/c423c63f-290d-4fdb-879b-8b5813b1f94c?as=iiif\",\"description\":[\"Northwestern University Marching Band performs at the Northwestern Wildcats' game against the Ohio State Buckeyes Gophers in Columbus, Ohio. The pregame performances include the Ohio State Fight Song and \\\"Go U Northwestern.\\\" Halftime performances include \\\"William Tell Overture (Theme from the Lone Ranger),\\\" \\\"April in Paris,\\\" \\\"Maxwell's Silver Hammer,\\\" and \\\"I've Got Rhythm.\\\"\"],\"id\":\"c423c63f-290d-4fdb-879b-8b5813b1f94c\",\"collection\":{\"id\":\"46f5d57a-bb83-4b58-bdc7-befa4b2498a9\",\"title\":\"Northwestern University Marching Band\"},\"title\":\"Northwestern vs. Ohio State\"}],\"pagination\":{\"query_url\":\"https://api.dc.library.northwestern.edu/api/v2/search/works?searchToken=N4IgRg9gJgniBcoDOBLAXgUwQRgDQgEcBXDAJzkRADsMjSBDAGwVAwFswMooUqBzFoRLkA%2BgBcMADzEIQAOQikxACwDuGJBNJUQ%2BANY4ADIfwAzFIy2DIEZpXOWyCANqgtbJIIAORMIxRIylwuYqQkALoAvpG4bmQeggBuAShgFihiFM4gAAq%2B-gDGIFGRJfhs0BiMIihQsgDyhkQAEgBqAKwAogBCiQBiAKrNpKbd2ACCaACSAyDRMSD0fHyelAUQVKGpRGKKgu6roOZVdfAg65uk27ukAHSM9JzM%2BKiYRuW8IlAQBSLrRJsEO1ovgCqQMPQbvt4ocQMdGKdzuDIYp7o8qroQK8sPBsCYQGxPt9fv9AfBgQs%2BBgqODoaQEvYUCdZFSaRg0U9Mdj3gSiT8-hAATJySCQA9%2BEQlji4vTYfDEeK%2BJKqRyMS90Di8R8qF9%2BaThRT8IwfpCUBs6QyjkyEbJjQVTRtVc8sRqeYSdcSBUKgaLNDBGBgRF4yGbTjLLXDrYi-QGgyHoE6ua7cfj3bqSYKyYasb4AFYYArC8NyqOyJB5gtiRPqt4p7Xpr1Z0USArKKgoYjSkAHQTy2QttsdkjVl21rW8j16zMG0XrRgBwtmnSUHuM5lnOcLsRL27bsQB256DAwVSKOo1nEAJkMotPpD04hgwYtJfXIDvD8yz4vCAAzKLklQNJ-EyF9e1LM5ANSdJQJ-eB-1FEQkEFUgCi7XgCkYIgoA0FwQFqTE9wDQjlCIDgqHoCxMU3SsdwI0FbC3HciKwfAcKQMEUC8bdzXwFB%2BNMAV51o3j8IEkQ2HodtTA0GR8Cg4CMjgcJ8CkTDsNw%2BBsjASFWxqKBPHwThlHoZI9iMiBJBECi2FY8BLOssjOFIajISYCA%2BBEI84FBJBEgkjAxHoKA3JEIgvBCiQRF